<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://qconsulting.ca/fo3/ModConfig5.0.xsd">
	<!-- Authored REV-68 Phase C (2026-10-02); structure verified against two
	     known-working local FOMODs (SeverActions 3.9.14, IntelEngine 3.5.0.1)
	     same session - canonical qconsulting schema URL, no alwaysInstall on
	     required files, one installStep (IntelEngine informational-Required
	     pattern; module content is not file-separable - module logic lives in
	     the shared motherboard pex, which is required). Player-facing title per
	     the REV-68 §7 rider; technical paths (folder names, manifest id
	     regalrascal.baka-gs-integration) are legacy Beta 25 load-bearing. -->
	<moduleName>Delectatio et Dominium (0.2.0-alpha)</moduleName>
	<requiredInstallFiles>
		<!-- Data-tree assets, source is the archive root (identical to the v0.2.0-alpha zip layout) -->
		<file source="SkyrimNet_BakaIntegration.esp" destination="SkyrimNet_BakaIntegration.esp"/>
		<file source="SkyrimNet_AnimationsGS.esp" destination="SkyrimNet_AnimationsGS.esp"/>
		<file source="SkyrimNet_AcheronIntegration.esp" destination="SkyrimNet_AcheronIntegration.esp"/>
		<folder source="Scripts" destination="Scripts"/>
		<folder source="SKSE" destination="SKSE"/>
		<folder source="Interface" destination="Interface"/>
		<folder source="Sound" destination="Sound"/>
		<folder source="textures" destination="textures"/>
		<folder source="PrismaUI" destination="PrismaUI"/>
	</requiredInstallFiles>
	<installSteps order="Explicit">
		<installStep name="Delectatio et Dominium">
			<optionalFileGroups order="Explicit">
				<group name="Install" type="SelectAll">
					<plugins order="Explicit">
						<plugin name="Delectatio et Dominium">
							<description>Bedroom drama for SkyrimNet - unified LLM-driven interaction scenes and solo posing.

Modules:
- Baka's Animations integration (escalation, reactions, modesty, spank, SexLab cues)
- AnimationsGS pose integration (solo posing, power-of-poses)
- Acheron downed-state bridge (Downed State section in MCM, 8 options)

All modules ship as one unit (REV-68 module lifecycle + consolidated MCM v5); each module is toggled in-game via its MCM section. All features configurable via MCM.

Requirements: SKSE, SkyrimNet, Acheron (for the downed-state bridge).</description>
							<files/>
							<typeDescriptor>
								<type name="Required"/>
							</typeDescriptor>
						</plugin>
					</plugins>
				</group>
			</optionalFileGroups>
		</installStep>
	</installSteps>
</config>

